# Example build-time environment for vault. Copy to `.env` (which is
# git-ignored) and fill in as needed. All vars are optional — the app builds
# and runs without any of them. See `docs/configuration.md` for details.

# Dropbox app key (PKCE public client). Unset hides the Dropbox storage
# backend in Settings → Storage. Register an app at
# https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps (scoped access, "App folder").
# The Dropbox backend is ALWAYS encrypted — see docs/features/storage.md.
# VITE_DROPBOX_APP_KEY=

# Dropbox app-folder name (`Apps/<name>/`), fixed by your Dropbox app config.
# Shown in "stored at" UI copy. Defaults to "Vault".
# VITE_DROPBOX_APP_FOLDER=Vault

# Deploy base path. Set per release channel by the Pages workflow (`/`,
# `/preview/`, `/branch/`); default `/` for local dev and preview builds.
# VITE_BASE=/

# Comma-separated absolute paths this build's service worker must disown —
# the sibling release channels nested under its base. Only the root release
# deploy sets it.
# VITE_PWA_IGNORE_PATHS=/preview/,/branch/
